#, xml-text
msgid "Graphviz Dependencies"
msgstr "Dependências do Graphviz"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/graphviz.xml:77
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Basic usage of <application>Graphviz</application> does not require any "
"libraries out of what is found in the LFS book. Its <quote>core</quote> "
"rendering engine is able to generate several graphic formats, such as "
"Postscript, SVG, VML, .fig, and Tk. Those formats can be converted to almost"
" any other format using tools from packages such as <xref role=\"nodep\" "
"linkend=\"imagemagick\"/>. The dependencies below add the ability to "
"generate graph images in bitmap format, to display the graph image on "
"screen, to edit a graph by viewing the resulting image directly, or to view "
"large graphs. Since <application>Graphviz</application> is a dependency of "
"several other packages in this book, it is suggested that you first build it"
" without any dependencies, and then rebuild it when you have built enough "
"packages to suit your needs."
msgstr ""
"O uso básico do <application>Graphviz</application> não exige quaisquer "
"bibliotecas além das encontradas no livro LFS. O mecanismo "
"<quote>central</quote> dele de renderização é capaz de gerar vários formatos"
" gráficos, como Postscript, SVG, VML, .fig e Tk. Esses formatos podem ser "
"convertidos para quase qualquer outro formato usando ferramentas "
"provenientes de pacotes como <xref role=\"nodep\" linkend=\"imagemagick\"/>."
" As dependências abaixo adicionam a capacidade para gerar imagens de gráfico"
" em formato de bitmap, para exibir a imagem de gráfico na tela, para editar "
"um gráfico visualizando a imagem resultante diretamente ou para visualizar "
"gráficos grandes. Como o <application>Graphviz</application> é uma "
"dependência de vários pacotes neste livro, é sugerido que você o construa "
"primeiro sem quaisquer dependências e, em seguida, o reconstrua quando tiver"
" construído pacotes suficientes para atender às tuas necessidades."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/graphviz.xml:93
#, xml-text
msgid "Recommended, for needed bitmap outputs"
msgstr "Recomendada, para saídas de bitmap necessárias"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/graphviz.xml:95
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"pango\"/>, with <xref linkend=\"cairo\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"xorg7-lib\"/>, <xref linkend=\"fontconfig\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"libpng\"/>, to generate images in bitmap SVG, postscript, PNG, and"
" PDF formats, or to display the image on screen. The PNG output is required "
"for building <xref role=\"nodep\" linkend=\"gegl\"/>."
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"pango\"/>, com <xref linkend=\"cairo\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"xorg7-lib\"/>, <xref linkend=\"fontconfig\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"libpng\"/>, para gerar imagens nos formatos bitmap SVG, "
"postscript, PNG e PDF ou para exibir a imagem na tela. A saída gerada PNG é "
"exigida para construir <xref role=\"nodep\" linkend=\"gegl\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/graphviz.xml:104
#, xml-text
msgid "Optional, for additional bitmap outputs"
msgstr "Opcional, para saídas de bitmap adicionais"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/graphviz.xml:106
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"aalib\"/> (for outputting images in ASCII art), <xref "
"linkend=\"cups\"/> (for formatting graphs for printing), <xref "
"linkend=\"qt6\"/>, and <xref linkend=\"webkitgtk\"/>"
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"aalib\"/> (para gerar imagens na arte ASCII), <xref "
"linkend=\"cups\"/> (para formatar gráficos para impressão), <xref "
"linkend=\"qt6\"/> e <xref linkend=\"webkitgtk\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/graphviz.xml:113
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Adding &gtk2; with <xref linkend=\"libjpeg\"/> adds support for JPEG, BMP, "
"TIF, and ICO formats, and allows displaying the image in a GTK+ window"
msgstr ""
"Adicionar &gtk2; com <xref linkend=\"libjpeg\"/> adiciona suporte para "
"formatos JPEG, BMP, TIF e ICO e permite exibir a imagem em uma janela GTK+"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/graphviz.xml:118
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<ulink url=\"https://www.libgd.org/\">GD Library</ulink> may be used instead"
" of <application>Pango</application>. It adds the ability to generate images"
" in GIF, VRML, and GD formats, but <application>Pango</application> provides"
" better outputs for the other formats, and is needed for displaying images"
msgstr ""
"<ulink url=\"https://www.libgd.org/\">GD Library</ulink> pode ser usado em "
"vez de <application>Pango</application>. Ela adiciona a capacidade de gerar "
"imagens nos formatos \"GIF\", \"VRML\" e \"GD\", mas o "
"<application>Pango</application> fornece saídas melhores para os outros "
"formatos e é necessário para exibir imagens"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/graphviz.xml:126
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Other formats may be added with <xref linkend=\"libwebp\"/>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://openil.sourceforge.net/projects.php\">DevIL</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://sourceforge.net/projects/lasi/\">libLASi</ulink>, and <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/glitz\">glitz</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"Outros formatos podem ser adicionados com <xref linkend=\"libwebp\"/>, "
"<ulink url=\"https://openil.sourceforge.net/projects.php\">DevIL</ulink>, "
"<ulink url=\"https://sourceforge.net/projects/lasi/\">libLASi</ulink> e "
"<ulink url=\"https://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/glitz\">glitz</ulink>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/graphviz.xml:133
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Optional (to load graphics that may be displayed inside the nodes of a "
"graph)"
msgstr ""
"Opcional (para carregar gráficos que podem ser exibidos dentro dos nós de um"
" gráfico)"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/graphviz.xml:137
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"libraryfile\">libgs.so</filename> from <xref "
"linkend=\"gs\"/>, <xref linkend=\"librsvg\"/>, and <xref "
"linkend=\"poppler\"/>"
msgstr ""
"<filename class=\"libraryfile\">libgs.so</filename> originária de <xref "
"linkend=\"gs\"/>, <xref linkend=\"librsvg\"/> e <xref linkend=\"poppler\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/graphviz.xml:143
#, xml-text
msgid "Optional (to build more tools)"
msgstr "Opcional (para construir mais ferramentas)"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/graphviz.xml:146
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<ulink url=\"http://www.cs.umd.edu/~mount/ANN/\">libANN</ulink> and <xref "
"linkend=\"freeglut\"/> (with <ulink "
"url=\"https://sourceforge.net/projects/gtkglext/\">GtkGLExt</ulink> and "
"<ulink url=\"https://gts.sourceforge.net/\">libGTS</ulink> for building the "
"<command>smyrna</command> large graph viewer, which is considered "
"experimental)"
msgstr ""
"<ulink url=\"http://www.cs.umd.edu/~mount/ANN/\">libANN</ulink> e <xref "
"linkend=\"freeglut\"/> (com <ulink "
"url=\"https://sourceforge.net/projects/gtkglext/\">GtkGLExt</ulink> e <ulink"
" url=\"https://gts.sourceforge.net/\">libGTS</ulink> para construir o "
"visualizador de gráficos grandes <command>smyrna</command>, que é "
"considerado experimental)"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/graphviz.xml:154
#, xml-text
msgid "Optional (to build language bindings)"
msgstr "Opcional (para construir ligações de idioma)"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genutils/graphviz.xml:156
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"swig\"/> (<application>SWIG</application> must be installed "
